<title>HONG KONG: HK's Tsang says no change in corp profits tax.</title>
<headline>HK's Tsang says no change in corp profits tax.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong Financial Secretary Donald Tsang said on Wednesday there would be no change in the territory's 16.5 percent tax rate on corporate profits.  </p>
<p>Tsang said Hong Kong's level of profits tax was already low in comparison with competitors in the region.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
